                {
                    "id": "641420302",
                    "speaker": "Babak",
                    "text": "This is the largest imported goods shop in Port Ormos. It is under the direct management of the Akademiya."
                },
                {
                    "id": "641420303",
                    "speaker": "Babak",
                    "text": "I am a researcher, and the shop manager."
                },
                {
                    "id": "641420304",
                    "speaker": "Babak",
                    "text": "There are a lot of tax exemptions due to official guarantees. So please be assured that these foreign goods are reasonably priced."
                },
                {
                    "id": "641420305",
                    "speaker": "Babak",
                    "text": "It also discourages smuggling in some way."
                }
